{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22444","headline":"自江州至忠州 · 白居易","name":"自江州至忠州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前在浔阳日，已叹宾朋寡。\n忽忽抱忧怀，出门无处写。\n今来转深僻，穷峡巅山下。\n五月断行舟，灩堆正如马。\n巴人类猨狖，矍铄满山野。\n敢望见交亲，喜逢似人者。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22444.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22444","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}